	(text "This resistors between IMODE and GND sets the Current Regulation\nmode of the DRV8874.\nWith 0 Ohm Resistor, the Curregulation Mode is FIXED and RETRY. \n\nFIXED means that after a Overcurrent on the limit set by the user\nwith the pin VREF, the DRV8874 waits for tOFF time of 25us, and\nthen automatically retries to feed the motor with the same control\nas before the fault (chopping behaviour)\n\nRETRY means that after a DRV8874 Overcurrent Protection \ntriggered, the Driver retries automatically to restart the motor\ncontrol. This refers to the general Current max threshold defined\nby the DRV8874, which can not be modified by the user (typically\nis at 10A) "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.098 125.222 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.762 0.762)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ebe46ed2-9183-4ecf-ad65-5fac58aca57c")
	)
